    <string name="about_author_name">ArrogHie</string>
    <string name="about_license_body">Import adapters reference the following open-source implementations: WakeUp Schedule (YZune, Apache-2.0) for the JwCourse data structure; WakeupSchedule_BUPT (dIT8Zv, Apache-2.0) for the parser and school-directory design; WakeupSchedule_Kotlin (YZune, Apache-2.0) for week-bitmap parsing. The XMU timetable API (Wisedu gsapp/wdkbapp) flow was researched and verified by this project itself (scripts under schedule/).</string>
